<title>UK: BayerHypo sets 300 bln lire 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerHypo sets 300 bln lire 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Commerciale Italiana, BNP and San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    04.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.583   PAY DATE    04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/A+    DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
